The inner loop accesses `z_i[j]` where `z_i = z + i` and `j` goes up to `z_size - i - 1`. So the maximum index accessed is `i + (z_size - i - 1) = z_size - 1`. So `z` needs at least `z_size` words. And `z_size = 2*p_size + 2`.

